From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SoSeDiK <mrsosedik@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 30 Apr 2024 15:28:45 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Item Modifiers API

Introduces the concept of "item modifiers". They are primary used to modify item packets before sending them to the player.
Item modifiers are a set of rules to apply to the item stacks before displaying them to the player.

The order of modifiers is handled by a string list of modifier ids in config (option "item-modifiers.modification-order").
Also adds "item-modifiers.add-unknown" to automatically add new modifier ids to the config
and "item-modifiers.log-missing-ids" to log if the id is missing from the config.

Plugins need to implement ItemModifier and call #register on them to enable them.

